# Build output of src/. Deliberately NOT committed at this stage: the plugin is
# not reachable from any profile yet (its bundle name is not in the blueprint
# `dsh.profile.bundles`, on purpose — registration happens once a tool actually
# works), so there is nothing that would load lib/. Flip to the
# `dsh-tia-openness-v17-min` convention (commit lib/, ignore nothing here) when
# the blueprint entry lands.
lib/

# .NET build output of the vendored C# engine (`engine/`, see docs/decisions.md
# D17). The first attempt at this package ignored only lib/, node_modules/ and
# *.log, so `git add -A` would have committed the engine's binaries and
# intermediate objects. `engine/` itself is source and stays tracked; only the
# build output below it is ignored.
engine/bin/
engine/obj/

# Local development links to the DeepSeek Harness runtime packages, created by
# scripts/link-dsh-runtime.mjs. They are never shipped: an installed plugin
# resolves @deepseek-ai/* from the profile's runtime resolution.
node_modules/

# Scratch output.
*.log
